Following AGENTS.md (E2E tests for UI workflows; API changes in
API.md):

- tests/e2e/tlsVerification.spec.ts: the "Skip TLS verification for
  source registries" switch is off by default, the start request only
  carries skipSourceTlsVerify when it is turned on, and its popover
  warns against it.
- tests/e2e/dependencyDetection.spec.ts: auto-added dependencies use
  their real default channel or no channel filter (never a guessed
  one), and unresolved required APIs are shown as a warning.
- API.md: the dependencies endpoint's channel parameter and the
  reason, api, requiredBy, defaultChannel, unresolvedApis and
  resolution fields.
- TESTS.md: the new and extended test files and the updated counts.

Full Playwright suite: 114 of 114 with one worker, as CI runs it.

